{"id":"e8b39213fac999be","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-relative-complement.md","title":"相对枚举的补集判定","display":"thm-relative-complement — 相对枚举的补集判定","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-relative-complement","aliases":["20-thm-relative-complement"],"display":"thm-relative-complement — 相对枚举的补集判定","chapter":"3","section":"3.3","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Theorem 3.3.15；Theorem 2.1.14 的相对化","source_pdf_pages":[62,94],"source_printed_pages":[26,58],"depends_on":["[[20-df-relative-ce]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-relative-complement"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-relative-complement</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-relative-complement — 相对枚举的补集判定"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 3.3.15；Theorem 2.1.14 的相对化"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62</span><span>94</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>26</span><span>58</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2c15e9656c322806\" href=\"?note=2c15e9656c322806\" title=\"20-df-relative-ce\">20-df-relative-ce</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2c15e9656c322806\" href=\"?note=2c15e9656c322806\" title=\"20-df-relative-ce\">20-df-relative-ce</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}relative\\text{-}complement}\\vdash\nB\\in\\mathcal R^A\\Longleftrightarrow\nB\\in\\mathcal E^A\\land\\omega\\setminus B\\in\\mathcal E^A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}relative\\text{-}complement}\\vdash\nB\\in\\mathcal R^A\\Longleftrightarrow\nB\\in\\mathcal E^A\\land\\omega\\setminus B\\in\\mathcal E^A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>把普通的两边交错枚举改成两边交错 oracle 枚举；每个输入仍恰好在一边出现。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 3.3.15；Theorem 2.1.14 的相对化；印刷页 26, 58；PDF 第 62, 94 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-relative-ce","status":"resolved","id":"2c15e9656c322806","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-relative-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-relative-ce","status":"resolved","id":"2c15e9656c322806","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-relative-ce]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}relative\\text{-}complement}\\vdash\nB\\in\\mathcal R^A\\Longleftrightarrow\nB\\in\\mathcal E^A\\land\\omega\\setminus B\\in\\mathcal E^A.","display":true}],"bytes":1069,"backlinks":[{"id":"2ea8548c98f572c3","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-relative-ce]]；see [[20-df-tred]]；see [[20-df-one-reduction]]；see [[20-thm-relative-smn]]；see [[20-thm-relative-complement]]。"},{"id":"7315f2111b653872","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-rel-arith]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-relative-ce]]；see [[20-thm-jump]]；see [[20-thm-relative-complement]]；see [[20-thm-hierarchy-closure]]；see [[20-thm-bounded-quantifier-closure]]；see [[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-221","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-relative-complement]] — 章 3；直接提供者 1 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-221","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-relative-complement]]"}],"outgoing":["2c15e9656c322806"]}